.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trellis-changelog-new 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-changelog\-new \- Add an unreleased changelog fragment
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis changelog new\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-\-package\fR] <\fB\-\-kind\fR> <\fB\-\-body\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add an unreleased changelog fragment
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
The package the change belongs to (optional when the workspace has exactly one releasable package)
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<KIND>\fR
Change kind (see [tools.trellis.changelog] kinds; defaults include Added, Fixed, Breaking, …)
.TP
\fB\-\-body\fR \fI<BODY>\fR
The changelog entry text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
